  "fee_source": "main.js comment 'fee = 0.0001 * ceil(txsize / 1024 bytes)'; node-sx send_to_outputs applies ceil(hexlen/2048) to the hex string from sx mktx (a7cc669); fb3c847 tests ceil((hexlen+2)/2048) but sets ceil(hexlen/2048), so a trial of 2048*k hex chars at multiplier k never terminates. Vectors assume a size stable across retries."
